  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "SINCE 2015",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">SINCE 2015</span></p>"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hockey is more than a game — it’s a battle of speed, precision, and heart. Every shift on the ice is a clash of power and control, where seconds decide heroes and silence breaks into thunder. The cold air bites, the skates carve, and the puck moves faster than thought — yet within the chaos, there’s beauty.",
      "html": "<h2 class=\"font_2 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Hockey is more than a game</span></span> — it’s a battle of speed, precision, and heart.&nbsp;Every shift on the ice is a clash of power and control, where seconds decide <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">heroes</span></span> and silence breaks into thunder. The cold air bites, the skates carve, and the puck moves faster than thought — yet within the chaos, there’s beauty.</h2>"
    },
